    "extraction_notes": [
      "Electrical characteristics are specified at TA = +25 degC unless otherwise stated; note 9 specifies pulsed measurement with pulse width <= 300 us and duty cycle <= 2% for the on-characteristic breakdown and gain/saturation rows.",
      "The DC current gain table contains guaranteed minimum hFE values at 100 uA, 1.0 mA, 10 mA, 50 mA, and 100 mA, plus a maximum hFE of 300 at 10 mA; the minimum and maximum at 10 mA are represented as separate gain points because the schema stores one bound per point.",
      "The typical curves on p. 5 were digitized from the plotted traces. Curve point values are approximate readings from the published graphs, with SI units used for axes and values.",
      "No output-characteristics figure was published, so Early voltage VAF was not extracted or fitted.",
      "The datasheet publishes VCBO and VEBO breakdown ratings, power dissipation, thermal data, and switching limits, but this BJT extraction schema has no corresponding supported spec fields; they are omitted rather than represented as unsupported facts."
    ],
    "omission_reason": "No output-characteristics or temperature-coefficient figure is published, so VAF and temperature coefficients cannot be extracted. Reverse-operation parameters, package parasitics, thermal behavior, noise, and unsupported breakdown or switching fields are outside this extraction schema."
